// ── 预览工具：模拟窗口的尺寸预设与拖拽缩放（属于原型工具，不属于软件界面）──
const winRoot=document.documentElement;
function updateSizeReadout(){
  const el=document.getElementById('sizeReadout');
  if(!el) return;
  const r=document.querySelector('.window').getBoundingClientRect();
  el.textContent=Math.round(r.width)+' × '+Math.round(r.height);
}
function setWinSize(w,h){
  if(w!=null) winRoot.style.setProperty('--win-w',Math.round(w)+'px');
  if(h!=null) winRoot.style.setProperty('--win-h',Math.round(h)+'px');
  updateSizeReadout();
  if(window.__syncDetailDefault) window.__syncDetailDefault();
}
function fitWindow(){
  const stacked=window.innerWidth<=1470;
  setWinSize(
    Math.max(900,Math.round(window.innerWidth-44-(stacked?0:342))),
    Math.max(600,Math.round(window.innerHeight-44))
  );
}
document.querySelectorAll('#sizePresets button').forEach(button=>{
  button.addEventListener('click',()=>{
    document.querySelectorAll('#sizePresets button').forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle('active',x===button));
    if(button.dataset.size==='fit'){ fitWindow(); return; }
    const [w,h]=button.dataset.size.split('x').map(Number);
    setWinSize(w,h);
  });
});
(function resizeHandles(){
  const stage=document.querySelector('.stage');
  const frame=document.querySelector('.window');
  const clamp=(v,a,b)=>Math.min(b,Math.max(a,v));
  let drag=null;
  stage.querySelectorAll('.rz').forEach(handle=>{
    handle.addEventListener('pointerdown',event=>{
      event.preventDefault();
      const r=frame.getBoundingClientRect();
      drag={axis:handle.dataset.rz,x:event.clientX,y:event.clientY,w:r.width,h:r.height};
      handle.setPointerCapture(event.pointerId);
      document.body.classList.add('resizing');
      document.querySelectorAll('#sizePresets button').forEach(x=>x.classList.remove('active'));
    });
  });
  window.addEventListener('pointermove',event=>{
    if(!drag) return;
    setWinSize(
      drag.axis==='s'?null:clamp(drag.w+event.clientX-drag.x,900,3400),
      drag.axis==='e'?null:clamp(drag.h+event.clientY-drag.y,600,2000)
    );
  });
  window.addEventListener('pointerup',()=>{
    if(!drag) return;
    drag=null;
    document.body.classList.remove('resizing');
  });
})();
window.addEventListener('resize',()=>{updateSizeReadout(); if(window.__syncDetailDefault) window.__syncDetailDefault();});

